{"availability":"available","full":"warc0s/llm-storyteller","name":"llm-storyteller","description":"Streamlit AI story generator with multi-step LLM prompting, local OpenAI-compatible models, and OpenRouter support.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":17,"forks":3,"created":"2024-11-27T14:34:56Z","updated":"2026-06-18T10:01:41Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["ai-story-generator","creative-writing","llm","openrouter","prompt-engineering","python","story-generation","streamlit"],"demo":"https://llm-storyteller.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.563Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.563Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.563Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:47:06.563Z","stars":17,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🆕 UPDATED MODELS - September 23, 2025 The online version now features updated free models: Nemotron Nano 9B, Llama 3.3 8B, GPT OSS 20B, and Gemma 3n E2B. Please note that the interface screenshots still show the previous model selection, but the functionality remains the same with these newer, more powerful models.","Welcome to LLM StoryTeller, an interactive web application that leverages Large Language Models (LLMs) to help you craft captivating stories effortlessly. Whether you're a student, writer, or enthusiast, LLM StoryTeller provides a seamless experience to generate, refine, and download your unique narratives.","Note: The application interface is in Spanish, but don’t worry! We will walk you through each step in detail in this README. The interface is intuitive, and with the included explanations and screenshots, you’ll find it easy to follow and understand the workflow. Here, you can see the main dashboard of the application:"],"features":["Guided Multi-Step Process: Directs LLMs through outlining, writing, and reviewing to ensure higher-quality stories.","Model Compatibili